---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = "+16072289269";
const phoneDisplay = "+1 (607) 228-9269";
---
<Layout title="Mini-Split Repair Gastonia NC | Ductless AC Repair | acrepairgastonianc.com" description="Ductless mini-split repair in Gastonia, NC. Wall units, ceiling cassettes, multi-zone. All major brands. Same-day available. Call +1 (607) 228-9269.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Services / Mini-Split Repair</p>
      <h1>Mini-Split Repair in Gastonia, NC</h1>
      <p>Specialized repair for ductless systems — wall units, ceiling cassettes, multi-zone. All major brands.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-white btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Ductless mini-splits demand specialized knowledge. Our technicians are trained in <strong>Mini-Split Repair</strong> for all major brands — diagnosing communication faults between indoor and outdoor units, refrigerant issues, inverter board failures, and sensor problems efficiently.</p>
      <p>Mini-splits are increasingly common in Gastonia: room additions, converted garages, historic homes without ductwork, and new construction with zoned comfort. We handle single-zone and multi-zone systems.</p>
      <h2>Common Mini-Split Issues We Fix</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Indoor unit not cooling or heating</li>
        <li>Communication errors between head and condenser</li>
        <li>Refrigerant leaks on line sets</li>
        <li>PCB / inverter board failures</li>
        <li>Fan motor and blower issues</li>
        <li>Drainage and condensate problems at wall units</li>
        <li>Remote and thermostat connectivity</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Same-day service is often available across Gaston County for standard mini-split repairs. Trucks are stocked with common sensors, capacitors, and line-set components.</p>
      <div class="cta-box">
        <p>Need mini-split repair in Gastonia?</p>
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
